 "title": "Clay County, South Dakota - Auditor &amp; Elections",
 "text": "Clay County, South Dakota - Auditor & Elections\nWelcome\nContact Us\nAuditor & Elections\nCarri R. Crum, County Auditor\nClay County Auditor's Office\n211 W Main St, Suite 200\nVermillion, SD 57069\nPhone: (605) 677-7120\nFax: (605) 677-6970\nE-Mail: carri.crum@claycountysd.org\nNicole Klunder, Chief Deputy Auditor\nGelynn Passmore, Deputy Auditor\nWhat does the County Auditor do? Click to find out!\nIf you are interested in an absentee ballot, please fill out the linked Absentee Ballot Application and either get the request notarized OR send a copy of SD Drivers License, US Military ID, US Passport, or another acceptable form of identification listed on the absentee form. Only military, overseas citizens, and spouses and dependents of military or overseas citizens are omitted from the ID requirement. An Absentee Ballot Application is still necessary. Regarding returning voted ballots, per SDCL 12-19-7, \"The voter shall either mail the ballot, deliver it in person or have it delivered to the person in charge of the election.\" Absentee ballots left in the courthouse drop box will not be counted.\nElection Truth & Transparency\nPRESS RELEASE: Voter Registration U.S. Citizenship Requirements and Voter Identification at the Polling Place\nGeneral Election Notices\nReferendum Election Notices\nRepublican Runoff Election Results\nPrimary 2026 Election Results\nPrimary 2026 Post-Election Audit Certification\nSD Secretary of State Website\nAbsentee Ballot Application\nVoter Information Portal : Find your polling place and view a sample ballot.\nVoter Registration Form : Please note that the State of SD requires an original signature on voter registrations. Voter registrations via e-mail or fax cannot be accepted. Proof of citizenship is required for new registrations.\nVoter Cancellation Form: Use this form to cancel your voter registration.\nVoter Registration Drive Instructions\nPolling Places by Ward\nMaps:\nRural Ward Map\nSchool District Map 2012\nVermillion City Ward Map\nUnderstanding your property tax bill.\nPoll Worker Training Sign Up\nDepartments & Offices\nAssessor (Director of Equalization)\nAuditor & Elections\nCommissioners\nEmergency Management\nExtension Office & 4-H Program\nHighway\nRegister of Deeds\nSheriff\nState's Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeterans\nWeed\nZoning - County\nZoning - Joint Jurisdiction\nOther Links\nBid & RFP Documents\nCareers & Service Opportunities\nCity of Vermillion\nClay County Fair & Achievement Days\nClay County Historic Preservation\nClay County Ordinances\nClay County Park Campground\nDakota Senior Meals/ROCS\nSDACO\nTownship Information\nUniversity of South Dakota\nVermillion Chamber of Commerce\nVermillion Public Library\nCopyright 2015 Clay County, South Dakota",
